				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Output): Regenerate Service.js.map with updated VLQ mappings\n\nThe embedded TypeScript source in Service.js.map is unchanged, but the VLQ-encoded mappings field has been regenerated — likely from a build-tool version bump or non-deterministic compiler output. File size: 53396 → 53393 bytes.\n\nNo functional change to the TauriMainProcessService runtime behaviour.",
			"SHA": "fa228dd1379a37242b606ae6150293417ad9c826"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
